<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How RentSmart Home may earn from qualifying purchases and how commercial links are disclosed.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="section-kicker">Commercial transparency</p><h1>Affiliate disclosure.</h1><p>Commercial links should be clear, useful and separate from editorial judgement.</p></div></section>
<section class="container content-section"><div class="prose">
<p>RentSmart Home may apply to affiliate programmes such as Amazon Associates, Impact or ShareASale. Mentioning a programme here does not mean it is active. When affiliate links are added, this page and the relevant article will be updated to reflect the actual relationship.</p>
<h2>What an affiliate link means</h2><p>If you buy through a qualifying link, the site may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. We will place a clear disclosure near relevant recommendations or links, rather than relying only on this policy page. Compare product details, fit, returns, current prices and manufacturer instructions before buying.</p>
<h2>How we approach product recommendations</h2><p>Recommendations should consider surface compatibility, load requirements, removability, installation limits, cost and safety. Payment does not guarantee positive coverage. We will not describe a product as tested unless the test has been documented.</p>
<h2>Advertising and independence</h2><p>If display ads or sponsorships are enabled, we will identify them as required and update this disclosure. Advertising does not buy favourable editorial conclusions. Readers can choose not to use a commercial link; prices and availability may change after publication.</p>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
